# Add patterns of files dvc should ignore, which could improve
# the performance. Learn more at
# https://dvc.org/doc/user-guide/dvcignore

# Feast writes its local stores (registry.db, online_store.db) INTO the feature repo folder,
# and Python writes __pycache__. Neither is a real input of the pipeline, so DVC must not
# count them - otherwise the feature_store stage (and training) looks "changed" after every run.
feature_store/feature_repo/data/
__pycache__/
